            <title>[ZEPPELIN-1874] zeppelin sparkr could not show all the result</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-1874</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;zeppelin sparkr could not show all the result&lt;br/&gt;
in my zeppelin web:&lt;br/&gt;
%spark.r&lt;br/&gt;
mtcarsDF &amp;lt;- createDataFrame(mtcars)&lt;br/&gt;
model &amp;lt;- glm(vs ~ mpg + disp + hp + wt , data = mtcarsDF, family = &quot;binomial&quot;)&lt;br/&gt;
summary(model)&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;results:&lt;br/&gt;
Deviance Residuals: &lt;br/&gt;
(Note: These are approximate quantiles with relative error &amp;lt;= 0.01)&lt;br/&gt;
     Min        1Q    Median        3Q       Max&amp;lt;br /&amp;gt;&lt;br/&gt;
-2.11025  -0.08567  -0.00069   0.13214   1.10483&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;in my linux tty shell:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;gt; summary(model)&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Deviance Residuals: &lt;br/&gt;
(Note: These are approximate quantiles with relative error &amp;lt;= 0.01)&lt;br/&gt;
     Min        1Q    Median        3Q       Max  &lt;br/&gt;
-2.11025  -0.08567  -0.00069   0.13214   1.10483  &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Coefficients:&lt;br/&gt;
             Estimate   Std. Error  t value  Pr(&amp;gt;|t|)&lt;br/&gt;
(Intercept)  -23.623    23.144      -1.0207  0.30739 &lt;br/&gt;
mpg          0.78475    0.65026     1.2068   0.2275  &lt;br/&gt;
