			&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;/ol&gt;
		&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ol&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;


&lt;p&gt;    SparkR interpreter send message which containing multiple whitespaces, newlines. But zeppelin frontend breaks the space characters. This should be handled by other issue. As you can see the screenshot below, the result sent from websocket keeps whitespaces and newlines until rendering.&lt;/p&gt;

